     "content_html": "social science techniques were used in efforts to improve social conditions"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171415,
     "content_html": "progressives were a diverse group with often competing goals"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171414,
     "content_html": "labor wanted to limit the power of concentrated capital"
